> alsa-utils directory and do a './cvscompile' to prepare the directory
> for use as a replacement tarball. Now I find this fails under autoheader
> and autoconf 2.13...
> 
> howarth@bogus:~/alsacvs/alsa-lib$ ./cvscompile
> /usr/bin/autoheader2.13: Symbol `VERSION' is not covered by /usr/share/autoconf2.13/acconfig.h
